  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc35:1.14": "Sp 2.941: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Saññattibahulā; divasaṁ mahājanaṁ saññāpayamānāti attho. … Viññattīti hetūdāharaṇādīhi vividhehi nayehi ñāpanā veditabbā, na yācanā.</i> “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Saññattibahulā</i>; the meaning is they are trying to persuade crowds of people during the day. … <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Viññatti</i>: not to be understood as asking for things, but as making known by various methods consisting of reasons, examples, etc.” ",
